+  // resolved by the AST transformer, which emits the branch's statements inline
+  // and leaves no IfStmt at all -- so the ContinueStmt is a bare statement of
+  // the loop body, there is no boundary left to reach, and every statement
+  // after it is emitted into the terminated block:
