+  // assumed. When the ContinueStmt IS last in an if-branch this leaves an empty
+  // unreachable block, terminated by the OpBranch that `visit(IfStmt)` now
+  // emits because `gen_label_` is never set, and spirv-opt's dead-branch
+  // elimination removes it.
